71-25/654904853_1129939242823358_7171986077159820390_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wyB8FR984YoQ7kNvwGzhNH-&_nc_oc=AdqERv5BrBHg59AVaAR4UW-kAQCPlnnNgrya1BzJ5AuiezSTho2XN-VoNhklo8XN1z8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAR9sywTzOuBhxPBDfPIVTQcbL1D4vzN2igSpItRaRFg&oe=6AF08FA8"}, "display_name": "Exoshock", "keywords": ["fps", "coop", "shooter", "scifi", "pve"], "long_description": "**EXOSHOCK  - The Firefight Redefined.** \n\nStep into a **1\u20134 player co-op sci-fi PvE shooter** driven by one vision: to deliver **the most visceral combat**.\n\nA hybrid co-op FPS **built for VR**, where **flat-screen players fight in your squad**. Full cross-play.\n{995872566894994}\n**COMMAND THE CHAOS** - You are a Division 9 operative, owned by the Basilisk Group. Board starships in transit, sabotage systems, steal data, and eliminate targets. Gear up, complete your Contract, get out, and return for another.\n{1781064126480031}\n**REDEFINE THE FIREFIGHT** - Enemies flank, suppress, and push your squad. Reload under fire, strike with melee, and cover your teammates. Find an opening and turn a desperate fight around.\n{1157746316934332}\n**ADAPT TO EVERY RUN** - Fight across three starships of varying sizes, including some of the largest maps ever built for VR. Semi-procedural objectives, six Resistance levels, and Contract Complications mean no two runs are the same. Face melee droid hordes, automated defenses, or hostile forces fighting each other.\n{1874930530624243}\n**BUILD YOUR ARSENAL** - Complete Contracts to earn currency and increase your Arsenal Level, unlocking primary weapons, secondary weapons, and items. Customize your armor, colors, patterns, and patches.\n{1900553691102407}\n**VR & PC. SAME SQUAD.** - Play solo or team up with friends in 4-player co-op. AI teammates fill the remaining squad slots. Solo play is also available completely offline.\n\n**JUST THE BEGINNING** - Early Access is our foundation. Expect some bugs and rough edges as we expand, refine, and improve EXOSHOCK with the community.", "short_description": "EXOSHOCK is a 1\u20134 player co-op sci-fi PvE shooter driven by one vision: to deliver the most visceral combat. A hybrid co-op FPS built for VR, where flat-screen players fight in your squad. Full cross-play. Play solo with AI teammates, even completely offline, or team up with friends in 4-player co-op."}]}, "developer_name": "PolarityOne", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exoshockgame.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://exoshockgame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "29641612585431494"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604298355_2077917902847986_4181662070278234482_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AHc-VoQXtZ0Q7kNvwHyObyv&_nc_oc=AdreuRwRUsR6j0STL175WVNyG7vSMFPGBIQYe08iNgXh1ZY8yuR50SFo1scTr9T5u2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJ5-sUZBJRnWJKraIol-EeylXPSNWI92v3gybjN4sv0g&oe=6AF08E40"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Exoshock", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"